### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Login (alice) – keep the token in a variable
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"alice-pass"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Create SELL order
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"symbol":"BBCA","side":"SELL","price":9000,"quantity":100}

### My orders (filter by symbol/status)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?symbol=BBCA&status=PARTIAL&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel order
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/orders/ORD-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trade history (public)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trades?symbol=BBCA&limit=20

### Market snapshot (public)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/market/tickers

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/market/tickers/BBCA

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/market/orderbook/BBCA?depth=5

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/market/trades/BBCA?limit=10
